#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:5 b65947e391864e0f84c292b46c86109f
msgid "Setup Guide for Parrot Disco"
msgstr "Parrot Disco 设置指南"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:10 07ff6f8bd17b468a93642e2431dc8904
msgid ""
"The Parrot Disco is a lightweight delta-wing with built-in camera and good "
"flight characteristics. This page will help you get setup with ArduPilot "
"running on your Disco."
msgstr ""
"Parrot Disco 是一款轻量级三角翼飞机，内置摄像头，飞行特性良好。本页将帮助您完成在 Disco 上运行 ArduPilot 的配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:15 0919490d61a44c9884ee6e0d1e4e8aa0
msgid "Prebuilt Firmware"
msgstr "预编译固件"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:17 759c5d318b58475d99e59dc2c96f6045
msgid ""
"A build of APM:Plane for Disco is automatically generated by the ArduPilot "
"autobuild system. You can see the builds here:"
msgstr "ArduPilot 自动构建系统会自动生成适用于 Disco 的 APM:Plane 版本。您可以在此查看构建版本："

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:20 5b654b97afc446eea37c60277c1eb08b
msgid "https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Plane/"
msgstr "https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Plane/"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:22 c606221e18094eb88be7b2d15a9fa9ea
msgid "the file you need to download is 'arduplane'."
msgstr "您需要下载的文件名为「arduplane」。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:25 1f165e42566f4027b8cca6ef950d987f
msgid "Building Firmware"
msgstr "自行编译固件"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:27 76bd2583931846e48e9591f8c0b8a449
msgid ""
"To build the ArduPilot firmware yourself you should use the waf build "
"system, which is included as part of ArduPilot. The command to build "
"APM:Plane for Disco is:"
msgstr ""
"要自行编译 ArduPilot 固件，应使用 ArduPilot 内置的 waf 构建系统。为 Disco 编译 APM:Plane 的命令为："

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:31 084b5c859bde4f148937573b85e673c3
msgid "``./waf configure --board disco``"
msgstr "``./waf configure --board disco``"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:32 de3ca7e0dc4949a2891f97b2e32d1e96
msgid "``./waf plane``"
msgstr "``./waf plane``"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:34 2aaa6d3f74d34deeb40d3bd73cd82970
msgid ""
"this will give you a file build/disco/bin/arduplane that needs to be "
"installed on your Disco."
msgstr "这将生成 build/disco/bin/arduplane 文件，需将其安装到您的 Disco 上。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:38 6c69fb775acc4e0b87cca8622f16fd3d
msgid "Networking"
msgstr "网络连接"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:40 edffffd8de464a05b8809f127d8e6613
msgid ""
"The Disco has a builtin WiFi access point, which will show up on your "
"network as \"DISCO-xxxxxx\" where xxxxxx is a device specific serial number."
" The WiFi has no password by default."
msgstr "Disco 内置 WiFi 热点，在您的网络中显示为「DISCO-xxxxxx」（xxxxxx 为设备专属序列号）。WiFi 默认无密码。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:44 835dd6558a9a4a96949efc81b6bb7abc
msgid ""
"You can also use USB networking if your operating system supports it. Just "
"plug a USB cable into the left most USB port on the back of the CHUCK module"
" and connect with your operating systems network manager."
msgstr ""
"如果您的操作系统支持，也可以使用 USB 网络连接。只需将 USB 线缆插入 CHUCK 模块背面最左侧的 USB "
"端口，并通过操作系统的网络管理器连接即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:50 ec7b0cb7a79442a99deb2f61d033d27a
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:52 b244dbc5e80246daa2cc66058a524059
msgid ""
"ArduPilot is usually installed in /data/ftp/internal_000/APM. You should use"
" adb to create that directory and put a copy of arduplane from the build "
"step in the directory."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 通常安装在 /data/ftp/internal_000/APM 目录下。您应使用 adb 创建该目录，并将编译步骤中生成的 "
"arduplane 文件复制到该目录中。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:56 dacf96c0948e46deac19f1c9bf5cae67
msgid ""
"You will need some additional setup and configuration files as well. A copy "
"of all of the required files is available here:"
msgstr "您还需要一些额外的设置和配置文件。所有所需文件的副本可在此处获取："

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:59 86edb58eb74142228cc0b2c989711086
msgid ""
"https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/Frame_params/Parrot_Disco"
msgstr ""
"https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/Frame_params/Parrot_Disco"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:61 a6e9219f247d4efda34fb81728b11502
msgid ""
"You will need to modify the /etc/init.d/rcS_mode_default startup script to "
"start ArduPilot. An example of a modified startup script to start ArduPilot "
"if it is installed is available here:"
msgstr ""
"您需要修改 /etc/init.d/rcS_mode_default 启动脚本以启动 ArduPilot。以下是一个修改后的启动脚本示例（在已安装 "
"ArduPilot 的情况下启动它）："

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:65 81a77f9eabe64d6c968aae568876b9c5
msgid ""
"https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/Frame_params/Parrot_Disco/rcS_mode_default"
msgstr ""
"https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/Frame_params/Parrot_Disco/rcS_mode_default"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:67 c7e03a29e3084e5092d77cc6d41b26e9
msgid "you may find the 'Raw' button useful for downloading that file."
msgstr "您可能会发现「Raw」按钮有助于下载该文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:69 67de4260f2384b84a5f387f843bff440
msgid ""
"That script will start ArduPilot is there is a start_ardupilot.sh script in "
"the APM directory."
msgstr "该脚本将在 APM 目录中存在 start_ardupilot.sh 脚本时启动 ArduPilot。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:72 5c8be8bc8db24f2fa4ed7441d768b789
msgid ""
"You will also need to install the start_ardupilot.sh script. A copy of a "
"suitable script is here:"
msgstr "您还需要安装 start_ardupilot.sh 脚本。合适脚本的副本在此处："

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:75 259019a3a0ef4341bb71cd1a0e74e3b4
msgid ""
"https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/Frame_params/Parrot_Disco/start_ardupilot.sh"
msgstr ""
"https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/Frame_params/Parrot_Disco/start_ardupilot.sh"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:77 c982675c43a64b2bad6992284fb88c51
msgid ""
"that starts the Disco FAN and then loops running ArduPilot. The loop is so "
"you can restart ArduPilot with a MAVLink preflight-reboot request from your "
"GCS without rebooting the Disco."
msgstr ""
"该脚本启动 Disco 风扇后循环运行 ArduPilot。循环的目的是让您可以通过地面站发送 MAVLink 飞前重启请求来重启 "
"ArduPilot，而无需重启 Disco 整机。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:81 349462c709894aa6b3b1760f9e60a588
msgid ""
"The startup script assumes that your Disco appears on the 192.168.42.0/24 "
"network for WiFi and 192.168.43.0/24 network for USB networking. It tells "
"ArduPilot to announce itself as a MAVLink device on those two networks. It "
"will pick up the first MAVLink capable ground station that connects on UDP "
"port 14550 on those networks."
msgstr ""
"启动脚本假定您的 Disco 在 WiFi 上显示为 192.168.42.0/24 网络，USB 网络为 192.168.43.0/24 网络，并告知"
" ArduPilot 在这两个网络上广播自己为 MAVLink 设备。它将接受在这些网络上 UDP 14550 端口连接的第一个支持 MAVLink "
"的地面站。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:88 bc05aa1a123e4b87af2ddb4e471faf96
msgid "Ground Station"
msgstr "地面站"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:90 c7a19e181a7a44cdb5fdf69f6721e483
msgid ""
"For configuring your Disco you will need a ground station software package "
"(GCS). There are several choices for use with Disco:"
msgstr "配置 Disco 需要地面站软件（GCS）。适用于 Disco 的地面站有以下几种选择："

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:93 badf8b04d608499da00b713ffbbcf4e7
msgid "MissionPlanner (windows only)"
msgstr "MissionPlanner（仅限 Windows）"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:94 38ead3959fd0462c87095e8b1f696ecd
msgid "APM Planner (cross platform)"
msgstr "APM Planner（跨平台）"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:95 9c6184e3c7a547958c79ab1da99ad19b
msgid "QGroundControl (cross platform)"
msgstr "QGroundControl（跨平台）"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:96 900a4fc730b2412699a1b0cf133a6a3a
msgid "MAVProxy (cross platform, experts only)"
msgstr "MAVProxy（跨平台，仅限专业用户）"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:98 749b94995c5542039fbd54df0d54e4cf
msgid ""
"They are all capable of controlling all aspects of the Disco setup and "
"flight, including autonomous missions."
msgstr "它们均能控制 Disco 设置和飞行的各个方面，包括自主任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:102 43311e3c48ed4a3eb1036cf8da671cf1
msgid "Transmitter Setup"
msgstr "遥控器设置"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:104 18a5bbeb1e864d2fb67c9d046b486093
msgid ""
"The usual way to fly a Disco with ArduPilot is with a SBUS receiver and "
"matching transmitter. You can also fly without a transmitter, but that is "
"only recommended for advanced users who are very familiar with automated "
"flight control with ArduPilot. We hope to support the Disco WiFi based "
"transmitter in ArduPilot in the future."
msgstr ""
"配合 ArduPilot 飞行 Disco 的常见方式是使用 SBUS 接收机和匹配的遥控器。您也可以不使用遥控器飞行，但这仅推荐给非常熟悉 "
"ArduPilot 自动飞行控制的高级用户。我们希望未来在 ArduPilot 中支持 Disco 基于 WiFi 的遥控器。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:112 a916d2658ff2402383824f98e3bab56b
msgid ""
"The telemetry output option of many R/C receivers can interfere badly with "
"the Disco WiFi. Make sure you do a R/C range check before flying and also "
"check that your WiFi telemetry has sufficient range for your needs. Many R/C"
" receivers with a telemetry option can disable the telemetry when binding. "
"Please refer to your receiver documentation for details. It is recommended "
"that you disable receiver telemetry if you find your WiFi telemetry link "
"from the Disco is affected by your receiver."
msgstr ""
"许多遥控接收机的数传输出选项可能严重干扰 Disco 的 WiFi。飞行前请务必进行 RC 通信距离检查，并确认 WiFi "
"数传链路的距离满足需求。许多带有数传选项的遥控接收机可在对频时禁用数传，详情请参阅您的接收机说明书。如果发现 Disco 的 WiFi "
"数传链路受到接收机干扰，建议禁用接收机数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:122 a9eef73125c24415b4028bc1e5e9ebd5
msgid "Loading Parameters"
msgstr "加载参数"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:124 1d72a5baa9d947a490eb9972e207a7d3
msgid ""
"You will need to load a set of parameters suitable for the Disco using your "
"GCS. A recommended set of parameters to start with is here:"
msgstr "您需要使用地面站加载一套适合 Disco 的参数。推荐的初始参数在此处："

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:127 ba0d5208e9f047c7b0092b6140e61d8c
msgid ""
"https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/Frame_params/Parrot_Disco/Parrot_Disco.param"
msgstr ""
"https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/Frame_params/Parrot_Disco/Parrot_Disco.param"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:129 4f0dc80d33ad4655bfc7bf9a614f78e5
msgid ""
"you can download that file directly for loading into a GCS with this link:"
msgstr "您可以通过以下链接直接下载该文件并加载到地面站："

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:132 857bba484d4a488e814b268fc40b964e
msgid ""
"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/master/Tools/Frame_params/Parrot_Disco/Parrot_Disco.param"
msgstr ""
"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/master/Tools/Frame_params/Parrot_Disco/Parrot_Disco.param"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:135 003660910d5b4167b6f850f7f3b95812
msgid "Compass Calibration"
msgstr "罗盘校准"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:137 9b9f41909f0845eea18feb5279733feb
msgid ""
"You need to calibrate the compass in your Disco before you fly. This must be"
" done with the hatch in place due to the magnetic catch on the hatch."
msgstr "飞行前需对 Disco 的罗盘进行校准。由于舱盖使用磁性卡扣，校准必须在舱盖盖好的状态下进行。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:141 7aead10beb604638960d948e916a2fcd
msgid ""
"Each GCS choice has an option to start a compass calibration. Please choose "
"on-board compass calibration for your GCS and follow the prompts."
msgstr "每个地面站软件均有启动罗盘校准的选项。请在您的地面站中选择机载罗盘校准并按照提示操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:145 bd8ec10188ef4c119e795490cce1348c
msgid ""
"Note that you may find you need to raise COMPASS_CAL_FIT to allow successful"
" calibration of the Disco, as the magnetic setup of the Disco hardware is "
"not ideal and won't produce a perfect fit. We recommend setting "
"COMPASS_CAL_FIT to 20."
msgstr ""
"请注意，您可能需要提高 COMPASS_CAL_FIT 以使 Disco 的罗盘校准成功，因为 Disco "
"硬件的磁场布局并不理想，无法产生完美的拟合结果。建议将 COMPASS_CAL_FIT 设置为 20。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:151 fe2b76c094444e12b365fc3fa41988df
msgid "Accelerometer Calibration"
msgstr "加速度计校准"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:153 cef56b7a56df442bb31ffbd2a6f8c728
msgid ""
"You also need to perform an accelerometer calibration. Please follow the "
"prompts in your GCS for the accelerometer calibration procedure. This will "
"only need to be performed once."
msgstr "您还需要进行加速度计校准。请按照地面站中加速度计校准程序的提示操作，此操作只需进行一次。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:158 2feacf81bb9648dcad4a847047b9c4a5
msgid "Airspeed Calibration"
msgstr "空速校准"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:160 0018704faca845c286fb6ff7fc699998
msgid ""
"Before each flight you should perform an airspeed offset calibration as the "
"airspeed sensor will vary in its zero value between power cycles."
msgstr "每次飞行前应进行空速偏移校准，因为空速传感器的零值会在每次上电后发生变化。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:164 47d638243bca4f048c17d383449f92e5
msgid ""
"You should loosely cover the pitot tube that is built into the power switch "
"and choose the pre-flight airspeed calibration option in your GCS."
msgstr "您应轻松遮住集成在电源开关中的皮托管，并在地面站中选择飞前空速校准选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:169 c800da98bf0e4718981f07f398fc710e
msgid "Stabilisation Check"
msgstr "稳定性检查"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:171 c1aa67af4fbd4eb0a59fcb0591d3da14
msgid ""
"Before each flight you should check the stabilization of the Disco by "
"changing to FBWA mode and checking the following:"
msgstr "每次飞行前应通过切换至 FBWA 模式并检查以下内容来验证 Disco 的稳定性："

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:174 a2702944bfe74e58bf26125a46080f1c
msgid ""
"roll the Disco to the right. The right elevon should go down, the left "
"elevon should go up"
msgstr "将 Disco 向右横滚，右侧升降副翼应向下偏转，左侧升降副翼应向上偏转"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:176 23724565fee84a92bd8ab56de82f7b2c
msgid ""
"roll the Disco to the left. The left elevon should go down, the right elevon"
" should go up"
msgstr "将 Disco 向左横滚，左侧升降副翼应向下偏转，右侧升降副翼应向上偏转"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:178 c0c8d015e62046938ad60bf736b3bbcd
msgid "pitch the nose up. Both elevons should go down"
msgstr "机头向上俯仰，两侧升降副翼均应向下偏转"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:179 235af561e35c450ca2e188aaf71ee96d
msgid "pitch the nose down. Both elevons should go up"
msgstr "机头向下俯仰，两侧升降副翼均应向上偏转"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:181 6ca38a33bdb146da85243316c73946a2
msgid ""
"Next you should check for correct transmitter control with the Disco held "
"level."
msgstr "接下来，在 Disco 保持水平的状态下检查遥控器的正确控制响应。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:184 66036fd3440b4c06867d87e77bf9b117
msgid ""
"input right roll on the transmitter. The left elevon should go down and the "
"right elevon should go up"
msgstr "遥控器输入右横滚，左侧升降副翼应向下偏转，右侧升降副翼应向上偏转"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:186 9487bf8ad5be450f91042c24a4e790ce
msgid ""
"input left roll on the transmitter. The right elevon should go down and the "
"left elevon should go up"
msgstr "遥控器输入左横滚，右侧升降副翼应向下偏转，左侧升降副翼应向上偏转"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:188 d5c8cf1b5ab34627ae80ebbc41d7038e
msgid ""
"pull back on the pitch (elevator) stick on the transmitter. Both elevons "
"should go up."
msgstr "遥控器向后拉升降舵摇杆，两侧升降副翼均应向上偏转。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:190 c6f4d00bf4174d7bad33081ad14c5395
msgid ""
"push forward on the pitch (elevator) stick on the transmitter. Both elevons "
"should go down."
msgstr "遥控器向前推升降舵摇杆，两侧升降副翼均应向下偏转。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:194 bd242c065e7942f59a095addd3133ea4
msgid "Takeoff"
msgstr "起飞"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:196 5fd0cacc9d2449ccbfc787907b85d758
msgid ""
"The Disco has a very low stall speed which makes it easy to launch in a wide"
" variety of ways. Some recommended ways are:"
msgstr "Disco 的失速速度非常低，使其可以通过多种方式轻松起飞。推荐的方式包括："

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:199 f2bf62b7fb0d4908a60aee54e098f309
msgid ""
"a side launch where you hold a wing close to the fuselage, and launch the "
"aircraft forward. An example is shown here:"
msgstr "侧抛起飞：握住靠近机身的机翼，将飞机向前抛出。示例如下："

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:205 3876eb7ba2c843d6b3c871260855b8d1
msgid "a forward throw launch, as shown here:"
msgstr "前抛起飞，如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:210 ba6d09048e084de1834dbac5690fefae
msgid ""
"Always launch into the wind, and be careful to keep your hand clear of the "
"propeller."
msgstr "务必迎风起飞，并注意手部远离螺旋桨。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:213 09c7e9d2f0824158b2f2d045ea4e9bc0
msgid ""
"Also note that you can configure Disco for \"shake to start\", to start the "
"motor when the airframe senses a shaking motion. That is set by the "
"TKOFF_THR_MINACC=4 parameter in the parameter file linked above."
msgstr ""
"另请注意，您可以将 Disco 配置为「摇晃启动」，即当机架感知到摇晃动作时启动电机。该功能通过上述参数文件中的 TKOFF_THR_MINACC=4 "
"参数进行设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:217 912b7cddf57146ccab0e3da11d294552
msgid "You can see a \"shake to start\" example here:"
msgstr "您可以在此处查看「摇晃启动」示例："

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:224 15c7553115f746728405a538655200d9
msgid "Flight Modes"
msgstr "飞行模式"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:226 4ac03bfb34024da99a1db2e2c73fad31
msgid ""
"For general stabilised flight FBWA mode is recommended. This is also good "
"for takeoffs and landings."
msgstr "对于一般稳定飞行，建议使用 FBWA 模式，该模式同样适合起飞和降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:229 922d54dbc5234c23b303baa5fde726e9
msgid ""
"For longer distance FPV flying CRUISE mode is recommended as it will hold "
"airspeed, height above ground and ground course."
msgstr "对于较长距离的 FPV 飞行，建议使用 CRUISE 模式，该模式可保持空速、离地高度和地面航向。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:232 8006bd03a91b49e781b609b59fdab1e3
msgid ""
"You should also setup your transmitter for easy access to RTL mode to bring "
"the plane home if you need to."
msgstr "您还应在遥控器上设置方便访问 RTL 模式的开关，以便在需要时将飞机召回。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:236 de0b2e7ed9ff446f9913b99d79dd7907
msgid "Manual Landing"
msgstr "手动降落"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:238 b5d43c09dde54c2e862914f8f1c141ad
msgid ""
"To land manually FBWA mode is recommended. Just point the plane in the "
"direction you want to land and drop the throttle. To come in more steeply "
"push the pitch stick away. To perform a nice flare pull back a small amount "
"on the pitch stick just before touchdown."
msgstr ""
"手动降落时建议使用 FBWA 模式。将飞机对准降落方向，然后收小油门。如需更陡的下滑角，可将俯仰摇杆向前推。在接地前稍微向后带杆，可实现漂亮的拉平动作。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:243 f6aea7191c3540c08ee24a6d8a43cf6f
msgid ""
"APM:Plane will automatically put the nose down a couple of degrees when at "
"zero throttle to keep the airspeed up. You can set how much nose down it "
"uses at zero throttle with the STAB_PITCH_DOWN parameter."
msgstr "APM:Plane 在油门为零时会自动将机头压低几度以维持空速。您可以通过 STAB_PITCH_DOWN 参数设置零油门时的压头量。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:248 2a19b20c4a9d4b8f8a9d57bf51f558f2
msgid ""
"Make sure you land with zero throttle or you risk breaking the propeller."
msgstr "请务必在油门为零时降落，否则可能损坏螺旋桨。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:252 1e15b4c28c1f46888a84680c262509f4
msgid "AUTO Landing"
msgstr "AUTO 降落"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:254 a47e2a231017423e9e78e4d03c5903cf
msgid ""
"When using an AUTO mission you can place a NAV_LAND waypoint where you want "
"to land, with a target altitude of zero meters. You also need to place an "
"approach waypoint about 200 meters before the NAV_LAND point, about 30 "
"meters above the ground. The Disco will automatically flare and cut the "
"motor as it approaches the landing point."
msgstr ""
"使用 AUTO 任务时，可在目标位置放置一个目标高度为零米的 NAV_LAND 航点。还需要在 NAV_LAND 点前约 200 米处设置一个离地约 "
"30 米的进近航点。Disco 将在接近降落点时自动拉平并切断电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:260 8400a2524eb44b71ba689c6932d93efb
msgid ""
"Note that the Sonar used on the Disco for landing flare detection does have "
"a tendency to sometimes produce false positives. That can cause the Disco to"
" flare early in the landing as it thinks it is close to the ground. Because "
"the Disco has such good glide characteristics this doesn't result in a "
"crash, but it does cause it to land well short of the target position."
msgstr ""
"请注意，Disco 用于检测降落拉平的声呐有时会产生误报，这可能导致 Disco 在认为接近地面时过早拉平。由于 Disco "
"的滑翔性能出色，这不会造成坠机，但会导致其在目标位置前方较远处降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:268 7b7705878a0845eb8c6c7ec2b49d9318
msgid "Log Files"
msgstr "日志文件"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:270 36dc18b404644541a0075f1f8dab2240
msgid ""
"There are two types of log files for the Disco with ArduPilot. The first is "
"a \"tlog\" which is stored by your GCS software on your ground station. The "
"second is a \"DF\" log, which is stored on board the Disco."
msgstr ""
"搭载 ArduPilot 的 Disco 有两种日志文件。第一种是「tlog」，由地面站软件存储在您的地面站上；第二种是「DF」日志，存储在 Disco"
" 机载。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:274 8a802819fb02432b81026b8039439103
msgid ""
"The log directory is /data/ftp/internal_000/APM/logs and can be accessed by "
"ftp. Just enter a URL like ftp://192.168.42.1/ in Windows Explorer if using "
"Windows to view the storage on the Disco and access log files. These files "
"have a \".bin\" extension (for binary log file)."
msgstr ""
"日志目录位于 /data/ftp/internal_000/APM/logs，可通过 ftp 访问。在 Windows 系统下，只需在 Windows "
"资源管理器中输入类似 ftp://192.168.42.1/ 的 URL 即可查看 Disco 存储并访问日志文件。这些文件具有 `.bin` "
"扩展名（用于二进制日志文件）。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:280 f60808a33ed04855b51f6b845bd4afe5
msgid "The C.H.U.C.K Autopilot"
msgstr "C.H.U.C.K 飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:282 53cbd66785f14d589e24507422d69579
msgid ""
"The heart of the Disco is the C.H.U.C.K autopilot, an orange box which is a "
"general purpose autopilot. It is perfectly possible to use the C.H.U.C.K in "
"a different airframe."
msgstr "Disco 的核心是 C.H.U.C.K 飞控，这是一个橙色方盒，属于通用型飞控。将 C.H.U.C.K 用于其他机架完全可行。"

#: ../../source/docs/airframe-disco.rst:286 b975c27791494ba7a20488eff60515b5
msgid ""
"For more information on using C.H.U.C.K with ArduPilot please see the "
":ref:`C.H.U.C.K AutoPilot <common-CHUCK-overview>`"
msgstr ""
"有关将 C.H.U.C.K 与 ArduPilot 配合使用的更多信息，请参阅 :ref:`C.H.U.C.K AutoPilot <common-"
"CHUCK-overview>`"
